# game/week6.rpy:8
translate indonesian week6_start_20b91661:

    # n "The atmosphere in Grapos was filled with excitement and energy."
    n  "Suasana di Grapos membuncah dengan luapan antusiasme dan energi yang membara."

# game/week6.rpy:9
translate indonesian week6_start_8cef90b7:

    # n "Music blasted throughout the area with a throbbing beat, vibrating in waves that sent a tremor through the ground itself."
    n  "Dentuman musik menggelegar ke seluruh penjuru dengan ketukan bas yang berdenyut kencang, menghantarkan getaran gelombang hingga ke tanah yang kamu pijak."

# game/week6.rpy:10
translate indonesian week6_start_f33119d5:

    # n "The audience churned like an excited mass, rising and falling to the music with colorful banners flying overhead."
    n  "Lautan penonton bergerak serempak bagai ombak yang bergelora, berayun mengikuti irama dengan spanduk-spanduk warna-warni yang berkibar tinggi di atas kepala."

# game/week6.rpy:11
translate indonesian week6_start_e80d1b54:

    # n "The smells of frying delicacies, sweat, and the faint metallic scent of cheap plastic ribbons from the trophy booths swirled in the air as the energy of hundreds of students built to a fever pitch."
    n  "Aroma gorengan yang gurih, semerbak keringat, dan samar wangi pita plastik murah dari stan piala berbaur di udara seiring membumbungnya semangat ratusan siswa."

# game/week6.rpy:13
translate indonesian week6_start_58902a47:

    # n "You were in your participant's zone, stretching your arms and trying to steady your beating heart."
    n  "Kamu berdiri di area khusus peserta, meregangkan kedua lengan sembari berupaya menenangkan detak jantungmu yang berdegup kencang."

# game/week6.rpy:14
translate indonesian week6_start_ff932015:

    # n "The competition was about to start, and as your gaze scanned the roaring crowd for a moment's respite, something caught your attention."
    n  "Kompetisi sebentar lagi akan dimulai, dan saat pandanganmu menyapu keriuhan tribun penonton mencari secuil ketenangan, sesuatu mendadak menarik perhatianmu."

# game/week6.rpy:15
translate indonesian week6_start_534d5366:

    # n "Someone was jumping up and down, their movements so energetic that they seemed to propel themself without touching the ground."
    n  "Seseorang terlihat melompat-lompat girang, gerakannya begitu lincah dan bersemangat seolah kakinya melayang tanpa menyentuh lantai."

# game/week6.rpy:17
translate indonesian week6_start_b72a6d9f:

    # n "There was Trida, their face lit with excitement as they bounced up and down on the bench in a flash of color that made them stand out in the front row."
    n  "Di sanalah Trida, wajahnya berseri-seri penuh antusias saat meloncat-loncat di atas bangku, menjadi pusat perhatian yang begitu mencolok di barisan paling depan."

# game/week6.rpy:18
translate indonesian week6_start_94bd3c92:

    # n "They were practically vibrating with enthusiasm, drawing cheers from the crowd, every fiber of their being caught up in the excitement of the moment."
    n  "Tubuhnya praktis bergetar saking hebohnya, memicu sorak-sorai dari penonton lain; setiap jengkal raganya larut dalam kobaran euforia saat itu."

# game/week6.rpy:20
translate indonesian week6_start_b47ac4fd:

    # trida "HEY [player_name]!"
    trida  "WOI [player_name]!"

# game/week6.rpy:21
translate indonesian week6_start_c942d21f:

    # trida "LOOK OVER HERE!"
    trida  "LIHAT KE SINI!"

# game/week6.rpy:32
translate indonesian week6_cheer_hero_e3dea5d2:

    # n "You can't help but laugh. Your attention turns toward them, and you strike a ridiculously heroic pose—one hand on your hip and the other pointing to the sky like a classic anime protagonist."
    n  "Kamu tak kuasa menahan tawa. Perhatianmu beralih sepenuhnya ke arahnya, lalu kamu memasang pose pahlawan yang konyol nan dramatis—satu tangan di pinggang dan tangan lainnya menunjuk ke angkasa laksana protagonis anime klasik."

# game/week6.rpy:33
translate indonesian week6_cheer_hero_828be884:

    # n "Trida absolutely loses it. They scream even louder, and their friends beside them start jumping and making a scene, turning into a singular roaring voice like a mosh pit."
    n  "Trida benar-benar lepas kendali. Ia berteriak semakin histeris, dan teman-teman di sampingnya ikut melompat-lompat heboh membuat kegaduhan, melebur menjadi satu gemuruh suara riuh bagai arena mosh pit."

# game/week6.rpy:34
translate indonesian week6_cheer_hero_2c494584:

    # n "You're so caught up in the showmanship, flashing peace signs and winking at them, that you almost miss the referee clearing their throat into the microphone."
    n  "Kamu begitu terhanyut dalam aksi pamer itu, mengacungkan pose dua jari seraya mengedipkan mata ke arahnya, sampai-sampai hampir tak mendengar suara juri yang berdeham di depan mikrofon."

# game/week6.rpy:39
translate indonesian week6_cheer_subtle_81127e86:

    # n "You force yourself to look straight ahead, jaw set. Your focus is on the podium, trying to tune out the sound of Trida shouting."
    n  "Kamu memaksa diri menatap lurus ke depan dengan rahang mengeras. Fokusmu tertuju ke podium, berusaha keras menepis suara teriakan Trida yang memekakkan telinga."

# game/week6.rpy:40
translate indonesian week6_cheer_subtle_c17a9b44:

    # trida "GO! THAT'S MY BEST FRIEND!"
    trida  "SEMANGAT! ITU SAHABAT TERBAIKKU TUH!"

# game/week6.rpy:41
translate indonesian week6_cheer_subtle_f238cc55:

    # n "Trida was screaming like they were at a world championship match."
    n  "Trida berteriak lantang seolah sedang menonton pertandingan kejuaraan dunia."

# game/week6.rpy:42
translate indonesian week6_cheer_subtle_8d206547:

    # n "Right as the countdown hits one, you can't help but look over and offer them a quick, tight-lipped smile."
    n  "Tepat saat hitungan mundur mencapai angka satu, kamu tak tahan untuk tidak melirik sekilas dan melemparkan senyum tipis yang tertahan ke arahnya."

# game/week6.rpy:43
translate indonesian week6_cheer_subtle_1e7ddccc:

    # n "As you see the flash of deep red spreading across their ears when they realize you saw them, they immediately duck back, looking thoroughly shy."
    n  "Saat rona merah padam menjalar cepat di kedua daun telinganya begitu ia sadar kamu melihatnya, ia langsung merunduk kikuk, tampak malu bukan main."

# game/week6.rpy:53
translate indonesian week6_quiz_start_ff71063f:

    # n "The referee steps up to the center mic and clears his throat. The crowd goes quiet."
    n  "Juri melangkah maju ke mikrofon utama di tengah panggung lalu berdeham membersihkan tenggorokannya. Suasana penonton seketika senyap."

# game/week6.rpy:55
translate indonesian week6_quiz_start_4d4d5d50:

    # moderator "Alright! Candidates, assume positions. We're going to test your general knowledge. First to three points takes the prize!"
    moderator  "Baiklah! Para peserta, silakan ambil posisi masing-masing. Kita akan menguji wawasan umum kalian. Peserta pertama yang meraih tiga poin berhak membawa pulang hadiahnya!"

# game/week6.rpy:60
translate indonesian week6_quiz_start_a68c6245:

    # moderator "What is the name of the longest river in the world, often debated between two major African and South American contenders?"
    moderator  "Apa nama sungai terpanjang di dunia, yang kerap menjadi perdebatan antara dua kandidat utama dari benua Afrika dan Amerika Selatan?"

# game/week6.rpy:63
translate indonesian week6_quiz_start_8ed61c12:

    # moderator "Incorrect!"
    moderator  "Jawaban salah!"

# game/week6.rpy:66
translate indonesian week6_quiz_start_d7981cf4:

    # moderator "Correct!"
    moderator  "Tepat sekali!"

# game/week6.rpy:68
translate indonesian week6_quiz_start_8ed61c12_1:

    # moderator "Incorrect!"
    moderator  "Jawaban salah!"

# game/week6.rpy:71
translate indonesian week6_quiz_start_afed4129:

    # moderator "What process do plants use to convert light energy into chemical energy, effectively acting as the lungs of the planet?"
    moderator  "Proses apa yang dimanfaatkan oleh tumbuhan untuk mengubah energi cahaya menjadi energi kimia, yang secara efektif bertindak sebagai paru-paru bumi?"

# game/week6.rpy:75
translate indonesian week6_quiz_start_d7981cf4_1:

    # moderator "Correct!"
    moderator  "Tepat sekali!"

# game/week6.rpy:77
translate indonesian week6_quiz_start_8ed61c12_2:

    # moderator "Incorrect!"
    moderator  "Jawaban salah!"

# game/week6.rpy:79
translate indonesian week6_quiz_start_8ed61c12_3:

    # moderator "Incorrect!"
    moderator  "Jawaban salah!"

# game/week6.rpy:82
translate indonesian week6_quiz_start_ea1514b6:

    # moderator "Which iconic Italian polymath painted the Mona Lisa and is often cited as the ultimate example of a Renaissance Man?"
    moderator  "Siapakah cendekiawan polimatik ikonis asal Italia yang melukis Mona Lisa dan kerap dinobatkan sebagai lambang puncak manusia Renaisans?"

# game/week6.rpy:85
translate indonesian week6_quiz_start_8ed61c12_4:

    # moderator "Incorrect!"
    moderator  "Jawaban salah!"

# game/week6.rpy:88
translate indonesian week6_quiz_start_d7981cf4_2:

    # moderator "Correct!"
    moderator  "Tepat sekali!"

# game/week6.rpy:90
translate indonesian week6_quiz_start_8ed61c12_5:

    # moderator "Incorrect!"
    moderator  "Jawaban salah!"

# game/week6.rpy:102
translate indonesian week6_quiz_win_92a7d2a6:

    # n "The announcer throws the bouquet right into your arms."
    n  "Pembawa acara langsung melemparkan buket bunga besar tepat ke dalam pelukanmu."

# game/week6.rpy:103
translate indonesian week6_quiz_win_97494beb:

    # n "They are massive and a bit tacky with a strong smell of the florist shop."
    n  "Buket itu sangat besar dan agak norak dengan aroma khas toko bunga yang menyengat hidung."

# game/week6.rpy:104
translate indonesian week6_quiz_win_39b38ba6:

    # n "You step off the stage and spot Trida waving towards you, their face lit with the expression of someone who witnessed a miracle."
    n  "Kamu menuruni panggung dan melihat Trida melambaikan tangannya penuh semangat ke arahmu, raut wajahnya berbinar bagai baru saja menyaksikan sebuah mukjizat."

# game/week6.rpy:106
translate indonesian week6_quiz_win_8cd40146:

    # p "Seriously now, holding these flowers feels like I have some Hollywood prop in my hands..."
    p  "Serius deh, megang bunga segede ini berasa lagi megang properti film Hollywood di tanganku..."

# game/week6.rpy:107
translate indonesian week6_quiz_win_b0837cb4:

    # n "Your hands still tremble from pulling the trivia trigger, but the sight of flowers could not fail to inspire emotion."
    n  "Kedua tanganmu masih sedikit gemetar akibat ketegangan menjawab trivia barusan, namun pemandangan bunga-bunga itu tak ayal memantik kehangatan emosi di dadamu."

# game/week6.rpy:108
translate indonesian week6_quiz_win_b51ec788:

    # n "After all, you did not expect to get to the end of the round without making mistakes or blanking out."
    n  "Lagipula, kamu sama sekali tak menyangka bisa melewati babak final tanpa kesalahan fatal ataupun pikiran yang mendadak kosong melompong."

# game/week6.rpy:110
translate indonesian week6_quiz_win_b81060e1:

    # n "You thought to give the bouquet a thorough once-over, then you focused your gaze on Trida."
    n  "Kamu sempat meneliti buket bunga itu lamat-lamat, lalu mengarahkan tatapanmu lekat-lekat pada Trida."

# game/week6.rpy:111
translate indonesian week6_quiz_win_afb50013:

    # n "They look genuinely delighted, as if they're about to burst into either tears or applause."
    n  "Ia tampak begitu gembira dan bangga, seolah sedang menahan diri antara ingin menangis haru atau meledakkan tepuk tangan meriah."

# game/week6.rpy:112
translate indonesian week6_quiz_win_798bd800:

    # n "A wave of tenderness washes over you as you remember that Trida has been a shoulder to lean on for the better part of recent weeks, helping you through difficult moments."
    n  "Perasaan hangat dan lembut mengalir menyelimutimu saat mengingat bagaimana Trida selalu menjadi sandaran andalanmu selama beberapa pekan terakhir, membantumu melewati saat-saat sulit."

# game/week6.rpy:114
translate indonesian week6_quiz_win_ab69b382:

    # p "Seriously now, this victory would be lesser without their aid. I think I am going to give these lovely flowers to them as a prize for being my idiotic cheerleader in the past few weeks."
    p  "Jujur saja, kemenangan ini terasa kurang berarti tanpa kehadirannya. Kupikir bunga-bunga indah ini lebih cocok kuberikan padanya sebagai hadiah karena sudah menjadi pemandu sorakku yang konyol selama ini."

# game/week6.rpy:120
translate indonesian week6_quiz_lose_201da217:

    # n "The buzzer goes off, and that is it—you lost."
    n  "Bel penanda berbunyi nyaring, dan semuanya berakhir—kamu kalah."

# game/week6.rpy:121
translate indonesian week6_quiz_lose_080bb8e0:

    # n "The person who won starts holding up flowers and celebrating. You do not even want to look at them."
    n  "Peserta yang menang mulai mengangkat buket bunganya tinggi-tinggi dan merayakan selebrasi. Kamu bahkan enggan untuk meliriknya sedikit pun."

# game/week6.rpy:122
translate indonesian week6_quiz_lose_37dcef58:

    # n "You are staring at the ground, feeling terrible about what happened. You made a mistake on a question you knew the answer to."
    n  "Kamu hanya terpaku menatap lantai, merasa begitu payah atas apa yang baru saja terjadi. Kamu melakukan kesalahan konyol pada pertanyaan yang sebenarnya kamu tahu persis jawabannya."

# game/week6.rpy:124
translate indonesian week6_quiz_lose_a6bbeb20:

    # n "Suddenly, you hear a loud cheer coming from the side of the field. You look up."
    n  "Mendadak, sebuah sorakan lantang terdengar dari tepi lapangan. Kamu mendongak."

# game/week6.rpy:125
translate indonesian week6_quiz_lose_f33b76de:

    # n "You see Trida standing on their toes, waving their arms in the air, and giving you a big thumbs up. Their face is bright red, looking a little silly."
    n  "Kamu melihat Trida berjinjit di atas ujung kakinya, melambaikan kedua tangannya ke udara sambil mengacungkan dua jempol besar ke arahmu. Wajahnya memerah terang, tampak sedikit konyol namun menggemaskan."

# game/week6.rpy:126
translate indonesian week6_quiz_lose_5fcdd677:

    # trida "It's okay!"
    trida  "Nggak apa-apa kok! Kamu udah keren banget!"

# game/week6.rpy:127
translate indonesian week6_quiz_lose_a330ace2:

    # n "You can tell they're trying to make you feel better from far away. They don't want you to be sad just because you lost."
    n  "Kamu tahu betul ia sedang berusaha keras menghiburmu dari kejauhan. Ia tak ingin kamu terpuruk sedih hanya karena sebuah kekalahan."

# game/week6.rpy:128
translate indonesian week6_quiz_lose_6db106be:

    # n "They look at you, stop for a second, and then start laughing warmly."
    n  "Ia menatapmu, terdiam sedetik, lalu tertawa hangat penuh keakraban."

# game/week6.rpy:129
translate indonesian week6_quiz_lose_742738cb:

    # p "Honestly, man, I owe them."
    p  "Sumpah deh, aku bener-bener berutang budi banyak sama anak itu."

# game/week6.rpy:141
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_e6a3d698:

    # n "They do not wait for you to come to them. They jog over, dodging through the crowd that is getting smaller."
    n  "Ia tak menunggu kamu berjalan menghampirinya. Dengan lincah ia berlari kecil, berkelit di antara kerumunan yang mulai menyusut."

# game/week6.rpy:142
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_3df02963:

    # n "Their hair is all messy from the humidity. Their cheeks are red from cheering so much. They're full of energy."
    n  "Rambutnya berantakan diterpa hawa lembap. Pipinya merona merah karena sedari tadi berteriak kencang menyemangatimu. Energinya tampak meluap-luap."

# game/week6.rpy:143
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_13d75d18:

    # n "They hand you a cup of tea and grab your elbow to take you to the shade under the bleachers."
    n  "Ia menyodorkan segelas teh dingin kepadamu dan memegang sikumu lembut untuk menuntunmu berteduh di bawah naungan tribun penonton."

# game/week6.rpy:146
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_04efd26a:

    # trida "You were great. Do not worry about the score. Come on, sit down for a minute. You look like you are going to faint."
    trida  "Penampilanmu tadi keren banget tahu. Nggak usah dipikirin skornya. Yuk, duduk dulu sebentar. Mukamu udah pucat kayak mau pingsan gitu."

# game/week6.rpy:147
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_6b0adef0:

    # p "Thanks..."
    p  "Makasih ya..."

# game/week6.rpy:149
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_c3010c52:

    # n "The air under the bleachers smells like grass, and you can smell the food from the canteen nearby."
    n  "Udara di bawah tribun beraroma rumput segar, berpadu dengan harum masakan yang terbawa angin dari kantin di dekat situ."

# game/week6.rpy:150
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_3e17c7ab:

    # n "You sit down on the bench. It feels good to be off your feet."
    n  "Kamu mendudukkan diri di bangku panjang. Rasanya sangat melegakan bisa mengistirahatkan kedua kakimu yang pegal."

# game/week6.rpy:151
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_3dda8ff9:

    # n "Trida pulls out a paper bag from their hoodie. They open it."
    n  "Trida merogoh sebuah kantong kertas dari saku hoodie-nya, lalu membukanya perlahan."

# game/week6.rpy:152
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_e152edd3:

    # n "You see your favorite snack, but it is all smashed and messy. They see you looking at it. Their ears turn pink."
    n  "Kamu melihat jajanan favoritmu di dalamnya, namun bentuknya sudah agak remuk dan berantakan. Menyadari kamu memperhatikannya, daun telinga Trida seketika bersemu merah muda."

# game/week6.rpy:155
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_d3876961:

    # trida "I know it is a mess. I got hungry waiting for you to finish. I am sorry. It does not look very good, does it?"
    trida  "Aku tahu bentuknya udah hancur berantakan. Tadi aku kelaparan pas nungguin kamu selesai tanding. Maaf ya... kelihatannya udah nggak menarik lagi kan?"

# game/week6.rpy:159
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_53651a9c:

    # p "What do you mean? It looks so good!"
    p  "Maksudmu gimana? Kelihatan enak banget begini kok!"

# game/week6.rpy:162
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_330e88af:

    # p "Oh shut up, look at those goodies."
    p  "Udah deh diam, makanan seenak ini masa diprotes."

# game/week6.rpy:164
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_85312c0e:

    # p "Don't mind it, it was the greatest thing ever."
    p  "Nggak usah dipikirin, ini camilan paling mantap sedunia."

# game/week6.rpy:167
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_899cad66:

    # n "You take a bite of the snack. It is warm and salty, and the flavor tastes good."
    n  "Kamu mengambil satu gigitan dari jajanan itu. Masih hangat dan gurih, rasa bumbunya terasa begitu nikmat di lidah."

# game/week6.rpy:168
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_5c7de0db:

    # n "As you eat, the noise from the field starts to fade. The crowd is still making noise, but you notice that Trida is quiet now."
    n  "Sembari kamu mengunyah, kebisingan dari arah lapangan perlahan mulai memudar. Penonton di luar masih riuh, namun kamu menyadari bahwa Trida kini terdiam tenang."

# game/week6.rpy:169
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_94143631:

    # n "They're not watching the field or the other students. They're watching you with their eyes on you, so it feels different. It is not like when you are just talking at school."
    n  "Ia tak lagi memandangi lapangan ataupun siswa-siswa lain. Tatapannya terpaku lurus menatapmu lekat-lekat, menghadirkan atmosfer yang terasa berbeda. Tak seperti saat kalian sekadar mengobrol santai di kelas."

# game/week6.rpy:171
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_e1dd7d67:

    # p "They say that intimacy is born in the space of the shared hour, but I felt it comes from something deeper—a feeling which only two people in the hall have learned to communicate in a shorthand language."
    p  "Orang bilang kedekatan lahir dari waktu yang dihabiskan bersama, tapi aku merasa ada sesuatu yang jauh lebih dalam—sebuah ikatan batin yang hanya dimengerti oleh dua pasang mata di lorong ini lewat bahasa tanpa kata."

# game/week6.rpy:172
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_a7d74632:

    # p "When they first showed up, I was too busy worrying about something else, that suddenly they were becoming my closest companion—"
    p  "Dulu saat ia pertama kali hadir, aku terlalu sibuk berkutat dengan rasa cemas hingga tak menyadari bahwa perlahan ia telah menjadi sosok terdekat dalam hidupku—"

# game/week6.rpy:174
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_0e361302:

    # n "As the school band launches into its lively performance, the sound envelops the area like an exhilarating wave."
    n  "Saat grup band sekolah mulai menghentakkan instrumen mereka dengan penuh gairah, dentuman nada mengalun menyelimuti sekeliling bagai gelombang yang mendebarkan."

# game/week6.rpy:175
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_5be78697:

    # n "The music blares with a powerful intensity, the bass thumping so deeply that it resonates through the air and sends vibrations rippling through the ground beneath."
    n  "Musik menggelegar dengan intensitas yang begitu dahsyat, dentuman basnya berdegup begitu dalam hingga beresonansi menembus udara dan menggetarkan tanah di bawah kaki."

# game/week6.rpy:177
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_9f57e364:

    # p "—Now, I feel them in everything they do, from the food they bring me and them helping me in class, or even every single time they wave at me and tell me how glad they are to know me."
    p  "—Kini, aku merasakan kehadirannya di setiap hal kecil yang ia lakukan, dari makanan yang ia bawakan, bantuannya di kelas, hingga tiap lambaian tangan riangnya yang menyatakan betapa bersyukurnya ia bisa mengenalku."

# game/week6.rpy:179
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_172ce799:

    # n "Trida turns their head to the stage, and their eyes light up. Without thinking, they reach out and grab your wrist with a firm grip."
    n  "Trida menolehkan pandangannya ke arah panggung utama, dan matanya seketika berbinar cerah. Tanpa ragu, ia mengulurkan tangannya dan menggenggam erat pergelangan tanganmu."

# game/week6.rpy:181
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_08014bcb:

    # trida "They already started the live music, let's go!"
    trida  "Live music-nya udah mulai tuh, ayo buruan!"

# game/week6.rpy:182
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_6fe7e370:

    # p "W-wait, Trida!"
    p  "E—eh tunggu, Trida!"

# game/week6.rpy:183
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_5992c92c:

    # trida "Come on, we're gonna miss it!"
    trida  "Ayo cepet, nanti kita kelewatan lagunya!"

# game/week6.rpy:185
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_93c22ae0:

    # n "You feel a shock when they touch you. It is like a spark of electricity that goes up your arm and to your chest."
    n  "Sebuah sengatan hangat menjalar saat kulitnya menyentuh tanganmu. Bagai percikan listrik yang merambat naik dari lengan hingga menembus rongga dadamu."

# game/week6.rpy:186
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_198724c1:

    # n "It is not a casual touch. It feels like they're trying to hold onto you. As they pull you up, your knees feel weak. Your heart is beating fast."
    n  "Itu bukan sekadar sentuhan biasa. Terasa sekali betapa eratnya ia ingin menggenggam dan membawamu bersamanya. Saat ia menarikmu bangkit berdiri, lututmu mendadak terasa lemas. Jantungmu berpacu kencang."

# game/week6.rpy:187
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_2c14d501:

    # n "You stumble forward, unsure if it is because of the music or because of the way they are touching you."
    n  "Langkah kakimu sempat tersandung canggung ke depan, gamang apakah rasa berdebar ini karena entakan irama musik atau karena kehangatan genggaman tangannya."

# game/week6.rpy:191
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_7271c46d:

    # n "Trida works their way through the thick crowd of students until they find themself swallowed by the mass, where you watch from the inside."
    n  "Trida terus melangkah menembus padatnya lautan siswa hingga tubuhnya larut tertelan kerumunan, tempat di mana kamu memperhatikan segalanya dari balik pundaknya."

# game/week6.rpy:192
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_7d4e55af:

    # n "You are pressed from all sides, almost without space to breathe. The whole group sways slightly, and the pressure from the others, together with the pounding music, creates a barrier through which the world outside has been shut away."
    n  "Kalian berdua terhimpit rapat dari segala arah, nyaris tanpa ada sisa ruang untuk bernapas lega. Kerumunan itu bergoyang pelan, dan sesaknya dekapan orang banyak ditambah hentakan musik yang menggelegar seolah menciptakan dinding pelindung yang mengisolasi dunia luar."

# game/week6.rpy:193
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_1a74629c:

    # n "For a moment, it seems as if this is all that exists."
    n  "Untuk sekejap, terasa seakan hanya ada kalian berdua di dunia ini."

# game/week6.rpy:195
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_6493f826:

    # n "The music erupts in a momentary pause to swell in your ears until suddenly the lead singer stands and screams something beautiful and sad into the metal grid above your heads."
    n  "Hentakan lagu mendadak berhenti sejenak dalam jeda hening yang menumpuk di telingamu, sebelum sang vokalis utama berdiri tegak dan melantunkan bait lirik yang begitu indah sekaligus memilukan ke udara."

# game/week6.rpy:196
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_49a056dc:

    # n "Your heart stops as you realize that it is most probably a love song, a confession perhaps, for it sounds as if the singer is addressing you directly as you hear the words for the first time."
    n  "Jantungmu serasa berhenti berdetak saat menyadari bahwa lagu itu pastilah sebuah lagu cinta—mungkin sebuah ungkapan perasaan yang tulus, sebab alunan suara sang vokalis terdengar seolah sedang berbicara langsung kepadamu."

# game/week6.rpy:197
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_63bd5306:

    # p "God, of course it's this song..."
    p  "Ya ampun... kenapa harus lagu ini yang diputar..."

# game/week6.rpy:199
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_34adcc4c:

    # n "It is so embarrassingly romantic that you feel as if they're speaking it out to everybody in the school."
    n  "Nuansa romantisnya begitu blak-blakan hingga kamu merasa seolah lagu itu sedang disuarakan terang-terangan kepada seluruh isi sekolah."

# game/week6.rpy:200
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_6b3114ed:

    # n "You start thinking over all those things that have happened over the last few months—how they brought you food, waited for you, and looked at you as if you were the only one in the world."
    n  "Benakmu seketika memutar kembali rentetan momen berharga beberapa bulan terakhir—bagaimana ia selalu membawakanmu makanan, menunggumu pulang, dan menatapmu seolah kamu adalah satu-satunya orang di dunia ini."

# game/week6.rpy:204
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_80bf807a:

    # n "Trida leans close to you, the warmth of their shoulder barely brushing against your own as they talk over the deafening music."
    n  "Trida mencondongkan tubuhnya merapat ke arahmu, kehangatan pundaknya bergesekan lembut dengan bahumu saat ia berbicara menembus bisingnya alunan musik."

# game/week6.rpy:205
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_1ec82d5a:

    # trida "Man, listen to that vocalist. I mean, the way they were singing really sounded incredible... Honest, you know."
    trida  "Keren banget ya vokalisnya. Cara dia nyanyi bener-bener kedengeran tulus banget... Jujur dari hati, paham kan maksudku."

# game/week6.rpy:208
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_dc1ab706:

    # n "They turn to you, eyes reflecting the thousand bright lights that flicker and dance overhead, glowing white-hot and flashing in all directions at once."
    n  "Ia menoleh kepadamu, sepasang matanya memantulkan kilau ribuan cahaya lampu sorot panggung yang berpendar di atas kepala, berpijar hangat dan berkelebat ke segala arah."

# game/week6.rpy:209
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_182f0da5:

    # n "For a moment, you are held spellbound by the sheer beauty of their gaze."
    n  "Untuk beberapa saat, kamu terpaku tak berdaya oleh pancaran tatapan matanya yang begitu mempesona."

# game/week6.rpy:210
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_d61bc721:

    # n "It is as if they're looking right through you, and the sheer honesty of their voice makes the very words sound as if they come from them, not the singer on stage."
    n  "Tatapan itu seolah menembus langsung ke dalam sanubarimu, dan ketulusan nada bicaranya membuat setiap kata-kata itu terdengar seakan terucap langsung dari bibirnya, bukan dari vokalis di atas panggung."

# game/week6.rpy:214
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_792cd181:

    # p "It feels… kinda want to sound personal, doesn't it?"
    p  "Rasanya... kayak pengin terdengar personal banget ya?"

# game/week6.rpy:217
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_04258188:

    # p "Yeah. It's honest. Maybe a little too honest, don't you think?"
    p  "Iya. Jujur banget liriknya. Malah mungkin terlalu jujur, menurutmu nggak sih?"

# game/week6.rpy:220
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_afa7d3bb:

    # p "Geez. That's—that's really loud. Like, emotionally loud."
    p  "Ya ampun. Itu... itu ngena banget. Bener-bener nyentuh ke perasaan."

# game/week6.rpy:222
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_8b00ddc8:

    # n "You watch them intently, noting every flicker of emotion that passes across their face."
    n  "Kamu mengamati wajahnya lamat-lamat, merekam setiap perubahan ekspresi lembut yang terlukis di parasnya."

# game/week6.rpy:223
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_c0b3c3d4:

    # n "They're still close, impossibly close, watching the stage as they hum along to the music almost absentmindedly, a lopsided smile playing across their lips."
    n  "Ia masih berada begitu dekat, sangat dekat hingga hembusan napasnya terasa, menatap ke arah panggung sambil bersenandung kecil mengikuti irama lagu dengan senyum manis yang tersungging tipis di bibirnya."

# game/week6.rpy:224
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_985d2870:

    # trida "Maybe. I don't know, but it's nice to hear something really true for once, isn't it?"
    trida  "Bisa jadi sih. Nggak tahu ya, tapi rasanya lega banget bisa dengerin sesuatu yang bener-bener tulus sesekali, ya kan?"

# game/week6.rpy:227
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_0c716227:

    # n "Before you have time to react, you find yourself caught up in the surging mass of people around you."
    n  "Sebelum kamu sempat menyahut, tubuh kalian berdua kembali terombang-ambing oleh gelombang dorongan orang-orang di sekitar."

# game/week6.rpy:228
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_ec2a4050:

    # n "The band launches into a second number with a driving rhythm that seesaws furiously, while the lead singer joins in, his voice a rich ballad of longing."
    n  "Band itu lanjut memainkan lagu kedua dengan tempo yang menghentak penuh dinamika, sementara sang vokalis kembali melantunkan balada kerinduan yang begitu syahdu."

# game/week6.rpy:229
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_d931def4:

    # n "You are so unaware of the surging mass around you that you are caught completely off guard when suddenly Trida runs right into you, knocking you off balance sideways."
    n  "Kamu begitu tak menyadari desakan kerumunan di sampingmu, hingga mendadak tubuh Trida terdorong keras dan menabrakmu dari samping hingga membuatmu kehilangan keseimbangan."

# game/week6.rpy:231
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_7d378782:

    # trida "Oh, sorry! I'm sorry, I'm really sorry this crowd is crazy!"
    trida  "Aduh, maaf! Maaf banget, beneran maaf kerumunannya lagi heboh banget dorong-dorongan!"

# game/week6.rpy:232
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_13a2b461:

    # n "Their face is lit up as they apologize genuinely, flashing an expression of surprise as they turn to one side to make room and straighten up."
    n  "Wajahnya merona terang saat meminta maaf dengan tulus, memperlihatkan raut kaget seraya buru-buru bergeser memberi ruang dan merapikan posisinya."

# game/week6.rpy:233
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_f1337a5d:

    # trida "They sound really good, don't they? This guitarist... I mean, it's a beautiful song! Just beautiful music..."
    trida  "Permainan musik mereka keren banget ya? Gitarnya itu lho... lagunya bener-bener indah banget! Musik yang luar biasa..."

# game/week6.rpy:237
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_d04670af:

    # p "My heart is hitting my ribs so hard I'm terrified they can actually hear it over the music."
    p  "Jantungku berdegup kencang banget menghantam tulang rusuk, sampai-sampai aku takut suaranya bakal kedengeran jelas nembus alunan musik."

# game/week6.rpy:238
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_f59fe365:

    # p "It's ridiculous. It was just a bump, just an accident. God, the air in here is suddenly so unbearably hot. I don't know where to look, I don't know what to do with my hands..."
    p  "Konyol banget rasanya. Tadi itu cuma senggolan biasa, cuma ketidaksengajaan. Tapi kenapa hawa di sini mendadak terasa begitu panas membara. Aku sampai bingung mau buang pandangan ke mana, serba salah harus naruh tanganku di mana..."

# game/week6.rpy:240
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_90837176:

    # n "Trida clears their throat as they turn back toward you, their hand hovering just above your sleeve."
    n  "Trida berdeham pelan seraya menoleh kembali ke arahmu, jemarinya melayang ragu tepat di atas ujung lengan bajumu."

# game/week6.rpy:241
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_f96a2bfe:

    # n "When the final note fades into the cheers of the crowd, the lights change abruptly from violet haze to bright white, and the magic is broken."
    n  "Ketika nada terakhir memudar diiringi tepuk tangan membahana dari para penonton, lampu sorot seketika berganti dari lembayung temaram menjadi cahaya putih terang benderang, memecahkan magisnya suasana."

# game/week6.rpy:242
translate indonesian week6_post_competition_a4957695:

    # n "The band begins to clear the stage as the chatter and noise of the next group drown out the music, leaving the charged tension between you and Trida to linger softly in the air."
    n  "Grup band mulai mengemasi instrumen di panggung seiring bisingnya obrolan grup penampil berikutnya yang menenggelamkan sisa musik, membiarkan desau ketegangan manis antara kamu dan Trida tetap menggantung lembut di udara."

# game/week6.rpy:260
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_07c499a5:

    # n "The walk back is silent, the rustling of leaves covering the noise of the school's rabble after the performance."
    n  "Langkah kaki kalian berdua menyusuri jalan pulang dalam keheningan, ditemani desau gesekan dedaunan yang meredam riuhnya sisa keriuhan festival sekolah."

# game/week6.rpy:261
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_a73a46a9:

    # n "You find yourself by the trunk of a tree, feeling that you have found a part of the world that is solely your own."
    n  "Kalian berdua akhirnya tiba di bawah naungan sebatang pohon rindang, menghadirkan sudut dunia yang terasa begitu sunyi dan privat, seolah hanya milik kalian berdua."

# game/week6.rpy:262
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_2e925dd2:

    # n "You and Trida stand in the shade of the tree, facing each other."
    n  "Kamu dan Trida berdiri di balik rindangnya keteduhan dahan pohon itu, saling berhadapan satu sama lain."

# game/week6.rpy:264
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_e7bcc68d:

    # n "You smooth the stems of the bouquet one last time before presenting the flowers across the small distance between you."
    n  "Kamu merapikan tangkai-tangkai buket bunga itu untuk terakhir kalinya sebelum mengulurkannya melintasi jarak dekat di antara kalian berdua."

# game/week6.rpy:265
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_34f1dd14:

    # n "You take a steadying breath."
    n  "Kamu menarik napas panjang untuk memantapkan hatimu."

# game/week6.rpy:267
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_61a20ded:

    # p "Hey Trida, here…"
    p  "Hei Trida, ini buat kamu..."

# game/week6.rpy:268
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_e01845bd:

    # n "You are surprised by how quiet your voice sounds."
    n  "Kamu sendiri kaget mendengar betapa lembut dan lirihnya nada suaramu terdengar."

# game/week6.rpy:269
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_761b939c:

    # p "I'm being serious. I don't really like those... so the flowers are probably better going to someone who actually wants them."
    p  "Aku serius kok. Aku sendiri nggak begitu suka nyimpen barang beginian... jadi bunganya pasti bakal jauh lebih berharga kalau dikasih ke orang yang bener-bener menghargainya."

# game/week6.rpy:272
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_75f72510:

    # n "Trida turns to you, regarding the flowers with an expression of utter, undiluted shock."
    n  "Trida menoleh menatap bunga-bunga itu dengan ekspresi keterkejutan yang begitu murni dan tanpa celah."

# game/week6.rpy:273
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_89b16583:

    # n "Their eyes are wide, blinking rapidly, and for a moment, you think they'll refuse to take them."
    n  "Kedua matanya membelalak lebar, mengerjap-ngerjap cepat, dan untuk sesaat kamu sempat mengira ia akan menolak pemberian itu."

# game/week6.rpy:274
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_30e62f61:

    # n "They tentatively reach forward and pull your wrist towards them before taking the stems from your grasp gently."
    n  "Dengan ragu-ragu ia mengulurkan tangannya, menarik lembut pergelangan tanganmu mendekat sebelum menyentuh dan mengambil tangkai-tangkai bunga itu dari genggamanmu dengan sangat hati-hati."

# game/week6.rpy:276
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_b92d25e9:

    # trida "You... in all seriousness?"
    trida  "Kamu... ini kamu beneran serius?"

# game/week6.rpy:277
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_2ad1a048:

    # n "Trida asks, their voice cracking ever so slightly."
    n  "Trida bertanya pelan, suaranya sempat bergetar tertahan di ujung kalimat."

# game/week6.rpy:278
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_d173c65c:

    # p "Yeah, come on, take them."
    p  "Iya, buruan ambil sana."

# game/week6.rpy:280
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_7e0b5772:

    # n "You encourage gently, laying the bouquet across their chest."
    n  "Kamu menyemangatinya dengan nada lembut, menuntun buket bunga itu bersandar di dadanya."

# game/week6.rpy:281
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_e2b71eb1:

    # n "You watch as they take the flowers with an almost reverent touch, their fingers shaking the entire time."
    n  "Kamu memperhatikan bagaimana ia mendekap bunga-bunga itu dengan sentuhan yang begitu takzim dan hati-hati, sementara jemarinya terus bergetar sepanjang waktu."

# game/week6.rpy:282
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_a8e59b64:

    # n "They stare intensely at the blooms, their face all red, their fingers fidgeting with the bow in their lap."
    n  "Ia menatap lekat-lekat kelopak-kelopak yang mekar itu, seluruh wajahnya merona merah padam, dan jemarinya memainkan pita hiasan di pangkuannya dengan salah tingkah."

# game/week6.rpy:283
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_dfe1be58:

    # n "They look utterly ridiculous and breathtaking all the same, and you feel your heart hammering wildly in your chest."
    n  "Ia tampak begitu menggemaskan sekaligus mempesona di saat yang bersamaan, dan kamu merasakan jantungmu berdegup liar tak keruan di dalam dada."

# game/week6.rpy:285
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_b4c0a894:

    # n "They look completely at a loss as to what to do with these strange flowers you have suddenly gifted them."
    n  "Ia terlihat benar-benar bingung dan kehilangan kata-kata tentang apa yang harus ia lakukan pada buket bunga indah yang baru saja kamu hadiahkan untuknya."

# game/week6.rpy:286
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_5561faa3:

    # n "They take a steadying breath, their shoulders hitch, and they look up at you, only to immediately turn back to the blooms in their lap."
    n  "Ia menarik napas panjang, pundaknya sedikit terangkat, lalu ia mendongak menatap matamu hanya untuk sedetik kemudian buru-buru menunduk kembali menatap bunga-bunga di pelukannya."

# game/week6.rpy:287
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_d690c4c4:

    # n "They look so surprised by your thoughtful gesture, so utterly not themself, that you think you have never seen them more beautiful in your life."
    n  "Ia tampak begitu tersentuh oleh perhatian tulusmu, begitu luruh dari sosoknya yang biasanya ceria dan berisik, hingga kamu merasa belum pernah melihatnya seindah ini seumur hidupmu."

# game/week6.rpy:289
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_a64984a2:

    # trida "I..."
    trida  "Aku..."

# game/week6.rpy:291
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_6bc299ab:

    # n "Trida whimpers, saying nothing more, only brushing their lips together before giving you a small, tiny smile."
    n  "Trida tercekat lirih, tak mampu melanjutkan kata-katanya; ia hanya mengatupkan bibirnya rapat-rapat sebelum menyunggingkan senyuman manis nan tulus kepadamu."

# game/week6.rpy:292
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_236400ba:

    # n "You feel so overwhelmingly happy, if only because they look so utterly stunned by your gesture."
    n  "Rasa bahagia yang luar biasa meluap membuncah di dalam hatimu, melihat betapa ia begitu terpana dan tersentuh oleh pemberianmu."

# game/week6.rpy:293
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_6767a781:

    # n "A calming stillness surrounds the tree as a gentle silence falls around both of you, as if the world paused to give Trida a moment of peace."
    n  "Ketenangan yang damai melingkupi keteduhan pohon itu saat keheningan lembut menyelimuti kalian berdua, seakan dunia sengaja berhenti berputar demi memberi Trida ruang ketenangan batin."

# game/week6.rpy:298
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_4cf41238:

    # braided_girl "Trida! Hey, come here! We were looking for you!"
    braided_girl  "Trida! Woi, ke sini! Dari tadi kita nyariin kamu tahu!"

# game/week6.rpy:299
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_0c517cbb:

    # n "Two of their friends round the corner from the gym, cell phones in hand, shouting excitedly."
    n  "Dua orang temannya tiba-tiba muncul dari balik sudut gedung olahraga, ponsel di tangan, sambil berteriak memanggil penuh semangat."

# game/week6.rpy:300
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_4164bed5:

    # n "Trida jumps at the sudden intrusion, eyes widening in surprise as they cradle the small bouquet of flowers."
    n  "Trida terlonjak kaget mendengar seruan mendadak itu, matanya membelalak kaget sembari mendekap erat buket bunganya di dada."

# game/week6.rpy:302
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_aa339c1b:

    # trida "Oh! Uh, hey guys..."
    trida  "Eh! U—um, halo semuanya..."

# game/week6.rpy:304
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_753e891b:

    # cap_boy "Radit has already begun his competition. Let us go and watch!"
    cap_boy  "Lomba Radit udah mau mulai tuh. Yuk buruan kita nonton bareng!"

# game/week6.rpy:305
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_35b21c77:

    # trida "Uhm..."
    trida  "Uhm..."

# game/week6.rpy:306
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_62bac436:

    # p "It's fine, just go there. I still have to do something after this..."
    p  "Nggak apa-apa kok, susul aja mereka ke sana. Lagian sehabis ini masih ada urusan yang harus kuselesaikan..."

# game/week6.rpy:307
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_32c522cc:

    # trida "Really? But..."
    trida  "Beneran nih? Tapi..."

# game/week6.rpy:308
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_2da24b9e:

    # p "...it's fine, Trida."
    p  "...beneran nggak apa-apa kok, Trida."

# game/week6.rpy:311
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_0d26fac6:

    # trida "Oh god. Sorry, I... I have to go. I mean, I'll see you later."
    trida  "Aduh ya ampun. Maaf ya, a—aku harus pergi dulu. Sampai ketemu lagi nanti ya."

# game/week6.rpy:312
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_ffff40df:

    # p "Yeah, yeah..."
    p  "Iya, santai aja..."

# game/week6.rpy:313
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_5e36293f:

    # trida "Thank you so much for all of this, by the way... See you later, I mean—I hope I see you later!"
    trida  "Makasih banyak ya buat semuanya yang tadi... Sampai ketemu lagi nanti, maksudku—semoga kita bisa ketemu lagi secepatnya!"

# game/week6.rpy:319
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_3a208b1b:

    # n "They do not wait for you to respond, their boundless energy already pushing them to take off running, clutching the flowers to their chest as if they were a prize."
    n  "Ia tak menunggu jawabanmu lebih lama; energi lincahnya yang tanpa batas langsung mendorong kakinya berlari kencang, mendekap erat buket bunga itu di dadanya laksana sebuah piala kemenangan berharga."

# game/week6.rpy:320
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_8d632823:

    # n "As they turn around, a flash of guilt crosses their face before they trot off toward their friends, giving you one last parting glance, cheeks flushed with embarrassment."
    n  "Saat tubuhnya berbalik, sekilas raut bersalah melintas di wajahnya sebelum ia berlari kecil menghampiri teman-temannya, melemparkan satu tatapan perpisahan terakhir ke arahmu dengan pipi yang merona malu."

# game/week6.rpy:321
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_38e2e190:

    # n "You see them turn around once more, showing off the bouquet of flowers to their friends, no doubt telling them an exaggerated tale."
    n  "Kamu melihatnya berbalik sekali lagi di kejauhan, memamerkan buket bunga cantiknya kepada teman-temannya yang pastinya diiringi bumbu cerita yang heboh."

# game/week6.rpy:322
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_2f11095b:

    # n "One of their friends nudges them in the side, their grin widening as they look back at you, head bent down in mock shame."
    n  "Salah satu temannya menyenggol jahil pinggang Trida, seringai usil merekah di wajah mereka seraya melirik ke arahmu, sementara Trida menundukkan kepala pura-pura malu."

# game/week6.rpy:324
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_7af9d7c2:

    # n "As they turn around again, a wave of unexpected tenderness washes over you."
    n  "Saat mereka kembali melangkah menjauh, gelombang rasa hangat dan haru yang tak terduga menyapu lembut hatimu."

# game/week6.rpy:325
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_258e6272:

    # n "This is turning out to be just another exhausting day after a competition, but you feel as if something amazing has just happened."
    n  "Hari ini memang berakhir melelahkan setelah rentetan kompetisi yang panjang, namun di dalam hatimu terasa seolah baru saja terjadi sebuah keajaiban yang luar biasa."

# game/week6.rpy:326
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_32166696:

    # n "Something that has bonded you to them in a way that will stay with you for a long time."
    n  "Sebuah ikatan manis yang terajut erat di antara kalian berdua, sesuatu yang akan membekas indah di ingatanmu untuk waktu yang sangat lama."

# game/week6.rpy:327
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_268a3c23:

    # n "As you trace small patterns over the rough bark of the tree with your fingers, a strange feeling of contentment washes over you."
    n  "Sembari jemarimu meraba pola-pola kasar di kulit kayu batang pohon itu, perasaan puas dan damai yang menyejukkan mengalir memenuhi rongga dadamu."

# game/week6.rpy:328
translate indonesian week6_bouquet_gifting_3c5e1788:

    # p "This has been a good day. It might even be the best day I have had in a long while."
    p  "Hari ini benar-benar hari yang indah. Bahkan mungkin hari terbaik yang pernah kualami setelah sekian lama."

# game/week6.rpy:334
translate indonesian week6_end_summary_328025e6:

    # n "The sun dips below the horizon, painting the sky in shades of deep indigo."
    n  "Matahari perlahan tenggelam di balik cakrawala, mewarnai langit senja dengan semburat ungu pekat dan nila yang memikat."

# game/week6.rpy:335
translate indonesian week6_end_summary_1997bcd3:

    # n "The memories of the music, the laughter, and the quiet moments linger warmly as you finally head home."
    n  "Kenangan akan melodi musik, tawa riang, dan detik-detik keheningan yang manis itu terus terngiang hangat saat kamu akhirnya melangkahkan kaki pulang ke rumah."

